{% comment %}
  Visitor map (Flag Counter).

  Setup:
    1. Go to https://flagcounter.com
    2. Customize the look (colors, columns, max flags) if you like.
    3. Click "GET YOUR FLAG COUNTER", then copy the HTML snippet for websites
       (looks like: <a href="https://info.flagcounter.com/XXXX"><img
        src="https://s01.flagcounter.com/count2/XXXX/..." alt="Flag Counter"></a>)
    4. Paste that snippet between the two marker comments below.
    5. Set `enable_flagcounter: true` in _config.yml.
{% endcomment %}
{% if site.enable_flagcounter %}
  <div class="flagcounter-container text-center mt-4 mb-3">
    <!-- >>> PASTE FLAG COUNTER SNIPPET BELOW THIS LINE <<< -->

    <!-- >>> PASTE FLAG COUNTER SNIPPET ABOVE THIS LINE <<< -->
  </div>
{% endif %}
